Day of the dead or Dia de los Muertos

Sugar skull theme for #fancy10kchallenge and Festival theme for #udm100k 
A festival to honor and celebrate loved ones past, such a beautiful notion and I wish this festival was more widespread. At least in my family, loved ones are often not mentioned much on passing to try to avoid bringing up painful memories. A day to remember and talk and learn more about them would be beautiful.

Products 
@mehronmakeup paradise paint for everything
@houseoflashes lashes in Noir Fairy

