What's your favorite thing to curl your hair with? Wand, regular curling iron, or flatiron? I like wands on day 2 of dirty hair😏 no extensions here either! Here's what im currently using on my hair in case you care😅-
@davinesnorthamerica Momo shampoo and conditioner (on Thursdays lol)
@briogeo Charcoal shampoo (on Mondays) with a deep conditioner 
I always do a deep conditioner once a week and switch between @davinesnorthamerica Hair Building Pak (AMAZING) and @briogeo Dont Despair, Repair mask
After my shower I put in-
@toppikhair Hair Fattener serum
@love_kevin_murphy Young Again serum (ALWAYS. always use a heat protectant)
@love_amika The Wizard detangler
@briogeo Milk Reparative leave in conditioner
@love_kevin_murphy Plumping Spray 💗
That's a LOT of products. But if I had to pick two products to help you get your hair healthy it would be the KM Young Again Serum and the Davines Pak deep conditioner. BUT shampoo and conditioner make a HUGE difference too. I can't remember the last time I used anything from a grocery store or pharmacy. Invest in your hair because it's worth it😏 to me anyway! Love you guys❤️
