AALIYAH: “Most Exalted One”
She was only 22 when she tragically passed, leaving a hole in every 90s baby hearts in the world.
Her music and talent can’t ever be replaced.
When I first got this PR package I was so emotional, specially after reading the wonderful message her brother @radmax6 wrote.
This collection truly is a tribute to her as a whole, and I’m very happy to have humbly created a look inspired by her and her era.
Video to follow ❤️
May you continue to Rest In Peace Baby Girl, we miss you 🙏🏻
