I see. 💙🦋
This look was inspired by the sixth chakra, The Third Eye. More commonly known as the pineal gland, located between the brows; the third eye chakra gives us our sense of intuition- the things that are experienced beyond the physical. Its purpose is to give us the ability to be open and imaginative. This is where our awareness of consciousness originates- vision, insight, and inspiration. If you are experiencing a lack of clarity, uninspired, and/or feeling distracted your third eye chakra may have an imbalance. Meditation, becoming more mindful: aware of what is going on around you and within you, cultivating silence: observing more and speaking less are a few ways you can open and heal your third eye chakra. 🌙💙🍃 Quick Facts💙
Element: Supreme Element (all elements combined)
Color: Translucent Purple 
Purpose: Intuition & Perception

