Happy Sunday❤️ it’s so pretty outside today🌤
Okay so I’ve been getting a lot of questions about my eyebrows lately so I’m telling y’all what I’ve been doing to grow them. If you’ve been following me from the beginning you know I had like 5 eyebrow hairs lol.  So I’ve come a long way! First thing is Nicole from @thebrowproject_ blessed my brows with the best microblading ever! She says that getting microblading can stimulate new hair growth and I’ve seen it on myself for sure. Also, for the last 2-3 months I’ve been using NeuBrow by @skinresearchlab every single night. That’s really stepped up the growth and I have so many new hairs. I bought it from Nordstrom online and it was on sale so that was a bonus. Then when I fill in my brows the product that helps me the most is @benefitcosmetics Gimme Brow bc it adds dimension and color to all the brand new hairs that I have. And I also use @maccosmetics Shape + Shade pen to add more hair strokes at the front of my brows. 
Soo there is what has worked for me! I’m so happy with my eyebrows and I thought I’d never say that. And to those that message or comment about noticing how much they’ve grown, I SO appreciate that! Y’all are the best❤️ lmk if you have any questions in the comments about any of this!
